# Keeps the heavy, web-irrelevant parts of the repo out of the build context.
#
# Every pattern here is ANCHORED with a leading slash. Without it these match a
# directory of that name at ANY depth — an unanchored `supabase/` also excluded
# `src/integrations/supabase/`, which broke the build with
# "Could not load /src/integrations/supabase/client". Do not drop the slashes.
#
# Root-level `supabase/` (the Edge Functions, deployed separately via the
# Supabase CLI) is deliberately NOT excluded: it is a few dozen small text
# files, and the pattern needed to catch it is the one that caused that break.

# Native shells — the Capacitor Android project and the separate Expo app
/android/
/gandd-mobile/

# Old Hostinger deploy artifacts and raw media
/gd1-deploy/
/my-video/
/*.zip

# SSR entry points, unused by the static build (kept in the repo as the
# Hostinger/Render rollback path)
/server.mjs
/vite.config.ts

/docs/
